{"text": "\u2014odginal Messoge\u2014\nFrom:\n\nChaikin, Karen\n\u2018Sont: Monday, July 19, 1999 6-49 PM\n\u2018Tor Darden, Benn C. Crabil, Jean; Hanson, Tery D.;Daragan, Kaen M,\nSubject: RE: YSPICRING 4-H Ming\n\nam confirming that we will meet with Mike Davis and his team in Cabbarus starting around\n3:00pm on Tuesday, Sept 21 and ending around noon on Wed, Sept 22. A preview of the\nAgenda Mike is putting together includes 4-H hosting us at one or more locations to meet\ntheir Cabbarus community leaders and leam about their local initiatives, Those attending\nfrom 4-H will include members of the community that sit on their Advisory Council as well\nas county and state 4-H personnel and Foundation members. 4-H will then host a dinner\nthat evening,\nThe following morning, just a select few from 4-H will meet with us at PM manufacturing\nplant to discuss possible joint 4-H/PM-YSPICR initiatives based on prior day's review.\n\nWhen | receive the Agenda, | will share with all. At that time, we can discuss inviting Mary\nJo Press to the Tues meetings and dinner as well as logistics we will need to cover for\nWed's meeting.\n\nKC\nYouth Smoking Prevention\n\nVPL6E98L 202", "words": [{"text": "\u2014odginal", "x0": 124, "y0": 157, "x1": 171, "y1": 167, "conf": 23.0}, {"text": "Messoge\u2014", "x0": 174, "y0": 157, "x1": 227, "y1": 167, "conf": 56.0}, {"text": "From:", "x0": 123, "y0": 169, "x1": 149, "y1": 176, "conf": 89.0}, {"text": "Chaikin,", "x0": 208, "y0": 168, "x1": 238, "y1": 176, "conf": 65.0}, {"text": "Karen", "x0": 245, "y0": 169, "x1": 269, "y1": 176, "conf": 84.0}, {"text": "\u2018Sont:", "x0": 119, "y0": 168, "x1": 150, "y1": 196, "conf": 42.0}, {"text": "Monday,", "x0": 208, "y0": 180, "x1": 241, "y1": 189, "conf": 55.0}, {"text": "July", "x0": 246, "y0": 180, "x1": 263, "y1": 189, "conf": 55.0}, {"text": "19,", "x0": 267, "y0": 180, "x1": 279, "y1": 188, "conf": 76.0}, {"text": "1999", "x0": 282, "y0": 180, "x1": 340, "y1": 188, "conf": 74.0}, {"text